[{"client_msg_id":"d69c35b8-c557-46ff-8a82-60a7b04d19cb","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"誰かに相談して解決する話ならしてあげた方が組織としても有益ですからね\nその問題点で離職者増える方が会社としては損失だし","ts":"1629888575.119100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U7ZUUQSBT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kOs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f35f8f4-6487-4a8b-a7e5-4db797d7785c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"無限に先送りしても事態は好転しないのでね","ts":"1629885326.117000","edited":{"user":"U03C71D7H","ts":"1629885332.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":7,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U7JL1UKKL","UD1FQV38V","U01J7703PFT","U01BY3SDBRS","U8CC7MDCL","U7ZUUQSBT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pvoN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f95a3261-db24-45c1-9beb-2669ae35297e","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"まだ分からないですけどね。少なくとも緊急事態宣言中は会社に戻れないですし。","ts":"1629885286.116700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Oq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eaafb1db-90d6-4d7f-9a1b-0ffb2705afdf","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"落ち着く目処が立ってるならよさそう","ts":"1629885167.115900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hwg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d7020c3-e5d2-41eb-8c78-dc9f90cadc38","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"仲間がいるのは:goodpoem:","ts":"1629884673.115600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JIM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cdad21c-7d7b-4098-9dc4-44da83f3ca7c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"まあ今はどこもかしこもてんやわんやになっているので、落ち着き次第同じこと思ってるメンバーと一緒にエスカレーションしますわ。","ts":"1629884639.115100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UD1FQV38V","UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"bloc